    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naayetonganirra omumaiso g'Omukama Agiripa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rukirabasaija Agiripa yagambira Paulo ati: “Hati oikiriziibwe kwetonganirra.” Aho Paulo yaimukya omukono gwe, yatandika kwetonganirra ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama Agiripa, ninyeyeta w'omugisa kiro kya hati kwetonganira omumaiso gawe habw'ebi byona Abayudaaya ebi barukunjunaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okukira muno habwokuba iwe omanyiire kimu engeso zoona n'empaka ez'Abayudaaya. Nahabweki ninkwesengereza ogumiisirize ompulirize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abayudaaya boona nibamanya engeso zange ezi naakuliiremu okuruga omu buto, omu bantu ab'ihanga lyange n'omu Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebik 23:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baf 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba nibammanya okuruga ira kandi basobora kukigumya hati, kakuba nibenda, nkooku ndi Mufalisaayo anyakukuraatira ekitebe ekirukukira ebindi byona kuhikya engeso z'ediini yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nyemeriire hanu ninjunanwa habw'okunihira Ruhanga eki yaraganiize baisenkuruitwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'enganda zaitu ikumi na ibiri eki zirukunihira kutunga obu baba nibeehayo kuramya Ruhanga ekiro na nyamusana. Waitu, habw'okunihira oku nikyo Abayudaaya barukunjunaanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2MA.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Mak 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu inywe habwaki mutarukwikiriza Ruhanga nkooku asobora kuhumbuura abafiire?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebik 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na nyowe nyenka nkaba ninyikiririza kimu nkooku nsemeriire kucwa amagezi goona kurwanisa ibara lya Yesu owa Nazareeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo naakozire Yerusaalemu. Nakwasa abaikiriza baingi omu nkomo habw'obusobozi obu naheebwaga banyakatagara abakuru. Tikiri eki kyonka, baitu obu bakaba nibacwerwa omusango gw'okufa, na nyowe nkakisagika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emirundi nyingi nabafubiraga omu masorrokaniro goona, nkalengaho kubahambiriza nukwo beehakane enyikiriza yabo. Nkabakwatirwa muno ekiniga, nukwo kubahiiganiriza nimbakurata n'omu mbuga ez'amahanga agandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naabaza ha kuhinduka kwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu kubakurata omu mbuga z'amahanga, nkaba ningenda Damasiko, mpairwe obusobozi kandi ntumirwe banyakatagara abakuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ihangwe obu nkaba ningenda, Waitu, nkarora ekyererezi nikiruga omwiguru, nikimuliikana okukira izooba, kyayaka kyanyehinguliriza nyowe n'abo aba nkaba ningenda nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itwena twagwa hansi, nubwo naahuliire iraka nirinnyeta omu Ruhebburaayo liti: ‘Saulo, Saulo noompiiganiriza ki? Nooyesaaliza wenka kusamba ha mihunda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namukaguza nti: ‘Niiwe oha, Waitu?’ MUKAMA yangarukamu ati: ‘Ninyowe Yesu ou orukuhiiganiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nu imuka, oyemerre. Eki ngenderiire kukubonekera nukwo kukukoma ompeereze kandi obe kaiso ow'okugumya nkooku ondozire, n'ow'okugumya ebindi ebi ndikweyolekeramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaakujuna abantu ab'ihanga lyawe, nkwihe n'omu mikono y'Abanyamahanga nambere ndukwija kukutuma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obaigule amaiso, baruge omu mwirima, baije omu musana; baruge omu busobozi bwa Sitaani, beehongere Ruhanga, kandi habw'okunyikiriza baganyirwe ebibi kandi batunge ekiikaro hamu n'abo abayeziibwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naasoborra omulimo gwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nahabweki nu, Agutamba Agiripa, okubonekerwa oku okw'omwiguru ntakwigalirize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebik 9:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu nkabanza kukurangirra aba Damasiko, nakusoborra aba Yerusaalemu n'ab'omu Buyudaaya yoona, kandi n'Abanyamahanga, nimbateererra beegarukemu, bagaruke hali Ruhanga, nibakora ebikorwa ebisemeriire abeegarukiremu kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo Abayudaaya bankwatiire ndi omunju ya Ruhanga, baalengaho kunnyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu habw'okukonyerwa Ruhanga, nikyo kinyemeriize hanu n'okuhika hati, nimmanyisa abakuru n'abato nkooku ntaina kindi eki ndukwegesa kwihaho abarangi na Musa ebi baarangire ngu, nibiija kubaho: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Kor 15:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.42.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 42:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "49:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo nkooku asemeriire kubonabonesibwa, kandi habw'okusangwa ali w'okubanza okuhumbuuka omu bafu, nuwe alimanyisa ab'ihanga linu n'Abanyamahanga boona omusana nkooku gwaizire omunsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naasoonasoona Agiripa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo obu akaba naakyayetonganirra ati, Fesito yamugambira n'iraka likooto ati: “Paulo ohunguutukire, amagezi gaawe amaingi gaija kukunaga iraro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Paulo yamugarukamu ati: “Oweekitiinisa Fesito, tingwire iraro; baitu nimbaza amazima kandi ebihikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Agiripa, ebigambo ebi abimanyireho, kandi nimmubaliza ntaina eki ndukutiina; habwokuba ningumiza kimu ebi byona nkooku arukubyetegereza, tibiri bintu ebyakoliirwe omu nsita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agutamba Agiripa, noikiriza eby'abarangi? Nyowe nimmanya nkooku orukubiikiriza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agiripa nukwo kugarukamu Paulo ati: “Mara iwe noogonza kumpindura Mukristo omu kasumi kake!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nandiki Paulo ati: “Obu karaaba kali kasumi kake rundi kaingi, baitu nyowe eki ndukusaba Ruhanga, tihali habwawe wenka, baitu na boona abarukumpurra ha kiro kya hati, mube nka nyowe--kwihaho muleke kubohwa omu njegere zinu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama yaimukire, hamu n'omulemi omukuru na Bereniike, n'abandi boona abakaba baikaliire nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baamazire kuturuka aheeru, baatandika kugambirangana bati: “Omusaija onu taina eki akozire ekisemeriire kumwisa rundi kumutaisa omu nkomo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agiripa yagambira Fesito ati: “Omuntu onu akusoboire kulekerwa, kakuba atarajuliire hali Kaisaali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
